  "hints": [
    "Use Dijkstra algorithm with heapq min-heap over adjacency list `adj[u].append((v, cost))`.",
    "Keep `dist = [inf] * n` initialized with `dist[start] = 0`, ignore popped entries where `d > dist[u]`, and return `d` as soon as `u == end`.",
    "Pseudocode:\n  pq = [(0, start)]\n  while pq:\n      d, u = heapq.heappop(pq)\n      if u == end: return d\n      if d > dist[u]: continue\n      relax neighbors"
